{
  "key": 11027,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_FaintMeansNoPowerToBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "When a Pokémon faints, it just means\n",
        "it doesn’t have the power to battle.\r",
        "But it can still use hidden moves\n",
        "outside of battle!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_TeamGalacticTookMyPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic took my Pokémon away.\n",
        "They took other people’s, too.\r",
        "Something should be done, but Team\n",
        "Galactic creeps everyone out...\r",
        "What are they doing to my Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_IGotMyPokemonBack",
      "en_US": [
        "I got my Pokémon back!\r",
        "I’m so happy, I feel like riding my Bike\n",
        "down Cycling Road together with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_BunearyBunbun",
      "en_US": "BUNEARY: Bunbun!"
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ShowHowClosePokemonFeel",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, you cute little Trainer!\n",
        "What kinds of Pokémon are with you?\r",
        "This Pokétch app will show how\n",
        "close your Pokémon feel to you.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_PokemonWillOpenUp",
      "en_US": [
        "If you spend enough time with them,\n",
        "all Pokémon will open up to you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OhYourPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi, you cute little Trainer!\n",
        "What kinds of Pokémon are with you?\r",
        "Oh, your {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ItSeemsToLikeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "It seems to like you.\n",
        "It must be happy being with you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_ItsBecomingComfortable",
      "en_US": [
        "It’s becoming comfortable around\n",
        "you, I think."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_NeedsToGetUsedToYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hmm...\n",
        "It needs to get used to you more."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OliNotEnoughPokemon_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Two Pokémon!\n",
        "That’s what we need.\r",
        "We’re looking for a Trainer who’s\n",
        "traveling with at least two Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OliIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! Would you like to battle against the\n",
        "both of us?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OliBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re live on camera, but try to act\n",
        "natural, OK?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OliBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "OK, that’s how it is, huh.\n",
        "Can’t do anything about that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_OliPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Whee!\n",
        "Wasn’t that battle smoking hot?\r",
        "You should make a Battle Video of it and\n",
        "share it with the world!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_RoxyNotEnoughPokemon_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, dear!\n",
        "You only have one Pokémon with you?\r",
        "That’s very commendable, but we can’t\n",
        "battle with you that way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_RoxyIntro_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Giggle!\n",
        "Could you win against both of us?\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_RoxyBattleAccepted_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ll thoroughly check out your\n",
        "abilities as a Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_RoxyBattleDeclined_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh? You haven’t healed your Pokémon,\n",
        "maybe?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_RoxyPostBattle_Unused",
      "en_US": [
        "That was a good match.\r",
        "It adds flair and drama when many\n",
        "eager Pokémon get involved."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolWish",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, Trainer!\n",
        "I have a dream.\r",
        "Could you help my CLEFAIRY\n",
        "learn Dazzling Gleam?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolBootedTM",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} booted up the TM.\r",
        "...\r",
        "...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolClefairyLearned",
      "en_US": [
        "CLEFAIRY learned\n",
        "Dazzling Gleam!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolDreamRealized",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! My dream has been realized!\n",
        "Thank you ever so much, Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolThanks",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah! My dream has been realized!\n",
        "Thank you ever so much, Trainer!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignIdolNoTM",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh...\r",
        "You can’t teach my CLEFAIRY\n",
        "Dazzling Gleam?\r",
        "Or you simply don’t want to?\r",
        "Sigh...\n",
        "Will my CLEFAIRY ever sparkle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignClefairyCry",
      "en_US": "CLEFAIRY: Pip piiih!"
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignWishSeen",
      "en_US": [
        "Someone, somewhere, saw that you\n",
        "made somebody’s wish come true."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Paige from Jubilife\n",
        "TV, the Fun-and-Games TV Station!\r",
        "We’re taking our quiz show all over\n",
        "Sinnoh. Answer five questions right,\r",
        "and you’ll win a fantastic prize!\r",
        "Today’s theme is the Unova\n",
        "region. Do you want to have a go?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello there! I’m Paige from Jubilife TV.\r",
        "Our quiz is for Trainers who’ve\n",
        "earned the Forest Badge.\r",
        "Come back once you have it,\n",
        "and we’ll roll the cameras!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerDeclined",
      "en_US": [
        "Aww... Well, we’ll be right\n",
        "here if you change your mind!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerRollCamera",
      "en_US": [
        "Wonderful! Roll camera!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerLetsFind",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s find out if you’re right!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWrong",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh no, I’m sorry... That’s\n",
        "not the right answer.\r",
        "You’re welcome to try again anytime!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "We have a winner! Congratulations!\r",
        "Your grand prize is the three\n",
        "Pokémon I just battled you with!\r",
        "The first partners of the Unova\n",
        "region: Snivy, Tepig and Oshawott!\r",
        "Talk to me when you’re\n",
        "ready to take them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNoRoom",
      "en_US": [
        "I’d love to hand over your prize, but\n",
        "your party needs room for all three!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerPrizeIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Here they are! The\n",
        "prizes for our winner!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerBye",
      "en_US": [
        "Thanks for playing! Keep\n",
        "watching Jubilife TV!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerCameraman",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m just the cameraman. Don’t mind me!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName1",
      "en_US": [
        "First, the Grass Snake\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s SNIVY!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived1",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a SNIVY!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname1",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this SNIVY?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName2",
      "en_US": [
        "Next, the Fire Pig\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s TEPIG!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived2",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received a TEPIG!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname2",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this TEPIG?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerName3",
      "en_US": [
        "Last, the Sea Otter\n",
        "Pokémon. It’s OSHAWOTT!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerReceived3",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received an OSHAWOTT!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerNickname3",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to give a nickname to\n",
        "this OSHAWOTT?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion1",
      "en_US": [
        "Here we go! Question one!\r",
        "In the Unova region, does Burgh\n",
        "lead the Castelia City Gym?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion2",
      "en_US": [
        "Correct! Question two!\r",
        "Does the Skyarrow Bridge link\n",
        "Castelia City with Nimbasa City?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion3",
      "en_US": [
        "Right again! Question three!\r",
        "Is Professor Juniper’s\n",
        "lab in Nuvema Town?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion4",
      "en_US": [
        "Brilliant! Question four!\r",
        "Is Elesa, the Nimbasa City Gym\n",
        "Leader, an expert on Fire types?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "EternaCityPokecenter1F_Text_SovereignInterviewerQuestion5",
      "en_US": [
        "Amazing! Here’s the final question!\r",
        "Can you beat me in a Pokémon battle?"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
